{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12730","headline":"清明日自西午桥至瓜岩村有怀 · 张继","name":"清明日自西午桥至瓜岩村有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚霁龙门雨，春生汝穴风。\n鸟啼官路静，花发毁垣空。\n鸣玉慙时辈，垂丝学老翁。\n旧游人不见，惆怅洛城东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}